The legal texts are laws of the Commonwealth of Dominica, as published by the Government of the
Commonwealth of Dominica on its web portal (https://dominica.gov.dm/laws-of-dominica), retrieved
29 October 2026. The portal states no reuse licence. Attribution: Government of the Commonwealth of Dominica.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text layer of each PDF was converted to one Markdown file per section;
page headers and page numbers were removed and spacing was normalised. The wording of the law was not
changed. The Government of Dominica does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
